Package: surfscape
Type: Package
Title: Continuous Landscape Structure and Its Change Through Time
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ehsan", "Rahimi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ehsanrahimi666@gmail.com"),
    person("Chuleui", "Jung", role = "aut"))
Description: Tools for separating compositional from configurational change in
    continuous landscape surfaces such as vegetation indices, canopy cover or
    productivity. Provides an exact three-way decomposition of the change in
    any moving-window metric into a shift in the landscape value distribution,
    a spatial redistribution of values among neighbourhoods and a rearrangement
    of values within neighbourhoods, together with an audit of whether a metric
    is able to respond to spatial arrangement at all. Built on 'terra' with a
    'Rcpp' window engine covering surface, texture, autocorrelation, entropy
    and lacunarity metrics.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
